## Canonical timeline notices and context maintenance markers.

# Context maintenance is still running. Short status caption; keep the ellipsis.
timeline-items-compacting = 압축하는 중...
# Provider explicitly reported automatic maintenance; do not imply a user action.
timeline-items-compacted-auto = 컨텍스트가 자동으로 압축되었습니다
# Provider explicitly reported user-requested maintenance.
timeline-items-compacted-manual = 컨텍스트가 수동으로 압축되었습니다
# Completed marker with no trigger/count metadata.
timeline-items-compacted = 컨텍스트가 압축되었습니다
# $tokens is already rounded integer thousands as a decimal string; keep the K unit.
timeline-items-compacted-tokens = 컨텍스트가 압축되었습니다 ({ $tokens }K 토큰)
# Fallback card for plugin content when its renderer is unavailable. Short title.
timeline-items-plugin-unavailable = 플러그인 콘텐츠를 표시할 수 없습니다
